  "system": {
    "description": "<p>This glamer allows you to mask a magic item’s aura from detection. It fools detect magical aura spells such that the item appears nonmagical. If the object bearing undetectable magical aura has instant identify cast on it, the examiner recognizes that the aura is false and detects the object’s actual qualities if he succeeds at a Will save.</p><p><strong>Focus</strong>: A small square of silk that must be passed over the object.</p>",
